if (document.cookie.split(';').some(cookie => cookie.trim() === '__DEBUG__=true')) { console.log('Ad logs: "mpu2", injectedAtParagraph: 8'); }

The plan involves installing monitoring sensors, establishing flood forecasting and warning systems, and building resilience to help downstream communities prepare for potential risks.

Nepal has executed similar interventions in the past, lowering the central Himalayan glacial lake of Tsho Rolpa by 3 meters (10 feet) in 2000 and completing a similar project at Imja, near Mount Everest, a decade ago.

URGENCY FOLLOWS RECENT DISASTER

The recent catastrophe served as a warning to the international community, Prime Minister Balendra Shah, 36, told the United Nations last month in a speech connecting the crisis to climate change despite Nepal's negligible emissions footprint.

